---------------------------
The model's weights were produced from synthetic training images rendered with
the Noto Sans Ol Chiki font family (Regular, Bold, Medium, SemiBold), part of
the Google Noto Fonts project. The fonts were used only to render training
images; the SIL Open Font License governs the font files themselves (this
project does not redistribute the font files under its own license).

