4. AI4Bharat IndicCorp corpus
-----------------------------
The Ol Chiki text corpus used to build the training word list and render the
synthetic samples was sourced from the AI4Bharat IndicCorp dataset
(Santali / `sat.txt`). The shipped default lexicon
(`olchiki_ocr/data/lexicon.txt`) is a filtered word list derived from this
corpus. IndicCorp is distributed under AI4Bharat's own terms (which are not a
standard OSI open-source license and may restrict commercial use or
redistribution); those terms — not this project's MIT/Apache-2.0 licenses —
govern the corpus and the corpus-derived word list. Its exact terms were not
